{"id":"4810","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4810_main_cirrus-castellanus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示卷云带有小圆形云塔或齿状物，从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的共同云底延伸，将其识别为堡状云种。它是白色的，但与堡状高积云不同，它没有底纹或阴影。在图像的底部，可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">雾状卷层云</span>云巾，没有明显的细节。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>处可以看到两架飞机凝结尾迹；两者都在非常高和精细的卷云和卷层云内。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Javier Ceberio García","location":"西班牙马德里","latitude":"纬度: 40° 22' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 36' 46'' W","date":"09 June 2014 1604 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= /, CM= /, CH= 5","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.6"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4810_syn_cirrus-castellanus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>大范围的低压区域覆盖西班牙。即将到来的槽加剧了不稳定性。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4810_upper_cirrus-castellanus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>不稳定的低层和条件不稳定的中间层，云标志从507到493 hPa和270到201 hPa </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4810_sat_cirrus-castellanus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>拍摄照片一小时后的卫星图像。在不稳定的前额气团中，积雨云细胞正在西班牙马德里东部发展。在马德里西部可以看到槽线上的中高层云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2013","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4842_main_cirrus-spissatus-and-castellanus-with-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>处厚大的密卷云斑块似乎是积雨云上部的残余部分。然而，在这一天英国的英格兰或威尔士上空没有形成积雨云。</p>\n<p>在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密云</span>主要斑块的顶部存在相当大的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云状发展</span>，这足以将该斑块重新分类为堡状云。还可以看到在这个云片的底部悬挂着不明显的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>。</p>\n<p>存在许多小的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>斑块，也存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云</span>细胞和几个区域的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Rodney Hale","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国中央贝德福德郡MK45贝德福德Houghton Conquest","latitude":"纬度: 52° 4' 5'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 28' 18'' W","date":"04 June 2015 1359 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 3, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.6"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5152_main_cirrus-castellanus-and-fibratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>图为堡状卷云实例，在海拔约2380米拍摄。从侧面看，亮白的卷云有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">角塔状凸起</span>。它们有公共云底相连，似乎成行排列。通常，角塔高度大于宽度。卷云受到对流层高空西南风的驱动，在高相对湿度条件下发展。在图上部，可见<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Rubén del Campo-Hernández","location":"西班牙，特内里费岛，圭马尔，伊萨纳大气观测站","latitude":"纬度: 28° 18' 32'' N","longitude":"经度: 16° 29' 58'' W","date":"29 April 2016 1532 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.6 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.6 2"}]}]}